<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-16T22:24:02.706Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:24:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Kulgam, Jammu and Kashmir, engaged a Lashkar-e-Taiba cell, killing commander Lateef Bhat and other attackers while recovering a body and weapon, and have intensified search operations. In Manipur, six Naga civilians were finally buried after 187 days, prompting heightened security and the redeployment of over 1,000 CRPF personnel from Chhattisgarh, including the withdrawal of an anti-Naxal battalion for Manipur duties. The CRPF also reported gathering vital clues on the Kulgam attackers and intensified search ops. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to its report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNWU9OTkxUT2lvdXVkQnc5TFd3TE82aTVMeFBWWTdEYS1MMFJwRUdMUEtCQzNQbi1rZGR0OVExWk00eGk0SUZaYXNEaDdBQkhwQzdVc1JsT0JSNHRCU2F6NWxsT3d2VVlBREVtSVMwVEdScU9IU2pNM0tpUGJZbHZzbHRqNXhndzZVV2J0anAzc3dFTndhNXdEb2JLOGJWYVRaMVJCbWFpMm9UQ0VQU0NodGo2UVh3WmxsS3JVVmpPNDNrSmlrcXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRjFLbDlRSlZfMS14MndXNmxKVTRtX3paeHJncEs2VXZ0b1M5Y2hhaVBlNm5Gb0hUclZJT2xKRmxRem5mRmFBVDY4Q0x4TS1qR2hmanhYSDFfYlRweFVrR1EwR3lYNTFOQWNocjlUekNpSmREZ08yZlBlalJuNDE1cm9oN3pvTjM4bTQtdHZMQkJsRkFhT01YdUpJOWp4VFdIbUR4cjRiS2dVemZGemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNRG1GYVE4N3AzUXRWSTdWUjVuRnZKV3NmV29DbS0ydE1fcDJ0bHJMUE1yUGlvdzZjYzc1ZDZBUVJLN2VzUkUxMU9TTEJONlE3amc4NzRiLWt1VnNkeXZyU0hReFcyOFhqLWxLTWV6bHlCcjhsYjkzRThpNWlaLUxpQ1FFc1RIN2VSdnVjc0N4UV9zaHRZOGNreTBGVi12SHBKTHo4UEh6ZnROdzFuVy1r?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://